   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tickets and validation",
     "texto": [
      "**A valida** means «to validate». **Validez** is «I validate» and **validați** is used to give a polite instruction to one person or several."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A useful false friend",
     "texto": [
      "**Bilet** is a transport ticket. It is not a banknote (that is **bancnotă**). For transport we say **cu autobuzul** («by bus»), an expression seen in A1."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
